  [$.sections[0].data] Hello everyone,

Could you please provide the next troubleshooting steps in regards to the Autopilot malfunctions?
May we should swap the FCC Cards from B to A ?
  [$.sections[1].data.FCC 2A PNR 822-0809-810 SNR] 4FM4CT
