  [$.sections[2].data.FCC 2B PNR 822-0809-810 SNR] 4FM4CT
  [$.sections[5].data] Good evening Marcus,

Having checked the previous FCCs all being NFF by Rockwell Collins we fully understood the suspicion this has build up on

But we want to highlight that this FCC s/n 4CX4R4 has had the fault confirmed and corrected by having the A4 Circuit boar

