BBD ADVICE REPLACE FCC. PN 822-0809-810.
ALTITUDE SELECT ADJUSTER FOUND TO OPERATE ON AP1 & AP2 BUT NOT AP3. DATA SOURCE IS ALTITUDE SELECT. DOES NOT OPERTE WITH CAPTAIN AS SOURCE DATA. FLIGHT CONTROL PANEL OPERATIONAL TEST C/OUT IAW 22-11-01-710-801. FAILS ALTITUDE TEST. INTERROGATION OF REPAIR CODES C/OUT. REPAIR SUMMARY SHOWED FC5' PANEL (LEFT). AS PER BOMBARDIER RECOMMENDATIONS, FCS REPLACED IAW 22-11-01-000/400-801. OPERATIO

